stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Stock: power on
    Stock --> Launcher: SD autorun, user picks "Start FM-STEP"
    Launcher --> Stock: no ENABLE / breaker / wrong firmware / bad payload / already tried this boot
    Launcher --> Supervising: launch_pending written, systemd-run supervisor
    Supervising --> Stock: stock stop failed / bad config (restore)
    Supervising --> AppStarting: stock stopped, devices free
    AppStarting --> AppHealthy: ready + heartbeats for healthy_after (pending cleared, failures=0)
    AppStarting --> Restoring: crash / freeze / ready timeout (consecutive_failures++, breaker at 2)
    AppHealthy --> Restoring: Exit to Stock ('X')
    AppHealthy --> AppStarting: runtime crash/freeze, restarts < max_restarts
    AppHealthy --> Restoring: runtime crash/freeze, restart limit reached
    AppHealthy --> Restoring: SD removed / supervisor SIGTERM
    AppHealthy --> Reboot: user reboot ('B')
    Restoring --> Stock: ac50 active + stock exe PID stable + dependencies restarted
    Restoring --> Restoring: failed once, retry
    Restoring --> RecoveryScreen: failed twice
    RecoveryScreen --> Restoring: DATA push (retry)
    RecoveryScreen --> Reboot: pad press or 60 s timeout
    Supervising --> RestoreSh: supervisor crash / watchdog kill (systemd kills app)
    AppHealthy --> RestoreSh: supervisor crash / watchdog kill
    RestoreSh --> Stock: start ac50 (3 tries)
    RestoreSh --> Reboot: gave up
    Reboot --> [*]
